

FL  = flip notes, beams, slurs.
FLU = flip all up.
FLD = flip all down.
FLN = flip to normal postions.
FER = fermata


Other "F" commands: f = f (forte), ff = double forte, etc.

f, ff, fff, fp

     These commands are shortcuts for typing code 9 items.  They should
     normally be followed by 2 or 3 numbers (parameters 2, 3, 4).

         mf 3 45 -2   will put "mf" at position 45 on staff 3,
                       vertical position -2.

     (See Code 9 for details.)



